{"id":"paisagem","lemma":"paisagem","pos":"noun","rank":3964,"glosses":["landscape (portion of land or territory which the eye can comprehend in a single view)","landscape (a picture representing a scene by land or sea)","the general characteristics of a biome"],"ipa":"/pajˈza.ʒɐ̃j̃/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"paisagens"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-paisagem.wav","examples":[{"text":"A paisagem é magnífica.","en":"The countryside is magnificent.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"magnificent","l":"magnífico"}]},{"text":"Eu admiro a paisagem.","en":"I'm admiring the landscape.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to admire","l":"admirar"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"A paisagem era de tirar o fôlego.","en":"The scenery was breathtaking.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,7,"breathtaking"]]},{"text":"A paisagem é de uma beleza indescritível.","en":"The scenery is beautiful beyond description.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"beauty"},{"g":"indescribable"}]}]}